{
  "case_id": "REN-SHIELD-BOUNDARY-26.1.2",
  "title": "【26.1.2 移植版:与 1.21.1 同用例同读数,逐行同构(2026-09-19 三线一致性测试;产品侧 ren 立牌已落地)】游戏大师立牌(ren)鼠鼠护盾:5 分钟窗口的边界与回拨口径(3 分钟不足 / 5 分钟恰好 / 未佩戴不补)",
  "version": "26.1.2",
  "target": {
    "type": "bugfix",
    "ref": "ren-shield-boundary"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的:把「被动间隔 = 5 分钟(6000 tick)」这个**常量**证伪/证实 —— 主用例 `REN-SHIELD-26.1.2` 只证明「真实等待 5 分钟会补盾」,任何 ≤6000 的实现都能过;本用例用回拨法补上**下界**。\n口径:①`renprep B1` 装备并复位(被动基准 last=0);②先读一次 `B1`,断言读数里的 `:now=` **≥ 6000** —— 回拨法要求「世界时钟大于回拨量」,不满足即 FAIL(而不是静默假通过);③`rentimer B2 3000`(只过去 3 分钟)⇒ 2.5 s 内**不得**补盾;④`rentimer B3 6000`(恰好 5 分钟)⇒ 补盾且护盾齐全(absorb=10 / counter=1 / res=1 / counterfx=1);⑤`renunequip B4N` + `rentimer B4N 6000` ⇒ 未佩戴者**不**补盾(负对照,由③④证明回拨机制真的有效,故不是假阴性);⑥`renvoid B5` 收尾清场。\n⚠️ 本用例必须在**世界时钟 > 6000** 的世界里跑(自然做法:紧随 `REN-SHIELD-26.1.2` 之后在同一会话运行,其 330 s 真实等待已把时钟推过 6000);探针改动需**冷启动**。\n【26.1.2 移植版】命令名/参数/读数键与字段顺序与 1.21.1 **逐字一致**(`res=` 取 26.1.2 的 `MobEffects.RESISTANCE`,依据见 `REN-SHIELD` 探针段头注 ①),故两条用例的 `AP_B*_*` 行可逐字 diff。本条对环境的硬前提(**世界时钟 `:now=` ≥ 6000**)在 26.1.2 上同样成立且同样被写成断言;自然做法不变 —— 紧随 `REN-SHIELD-26.1.2`(含 330s 真实等待)之后在同一会话运行即可满足。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renprep B1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renread B1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe rentimer B2 3000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renread B2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe rentimer B3 6000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renread B3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renunequip B4N",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe rentimer B4N 6000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renread B4N",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renvoid B5",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1600
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B1_STATE:shield=0:absorb=0:counter=0:res=0:base=0:last=[0-9]+:now=([6-9][0-9]{3}|[0-9]{5,})"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_TIMER:armed=1:rewound=3000"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_STATE:shield=0:absorb=0:counter=0:res=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B3_TIMER:armed=1:rewound=6000"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B3_STATE:shield=1:absorb=10:counter=1:res=1:base=0.*counterfx=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B4N_TIMER:armed=0:rewound=6000"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B4N_STATE:shield=0:absorb=0:counter=0:res=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B[0-9N]+_ERR|AP_B[0-9N]+_EX"
    },
    {
      "type": "kubejs"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ],
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running"
}
